      rust: tree-sitter-rust 0.24.2 and the syntax of current Rust
      
      semgrep-rust pins tree-sitter-rust v0.24.2, generated with tree-sitter 0.22.6; core is the commit with cmdliner 2 support. The extension keeps '...' as the ellipsis in token trees, lexes each punctuation symbol of a token tree as one token kind and a line comment as one token, and parses safe items, negative const arguments, f16 and f128 suffixes and the unstable syntax of the Rust standard library.
